1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:02,730
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) He finds a dog on the street.

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,990
There is no collar.

3
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,410
He likes dogs.

4
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:09,970
He takes it to his house.

5
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:12,010
He washes it.

6
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:15,030
He takes it to the veterinarian.

7
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:17,250
The dog is sick.

8
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:19,730
It will die soon.

9
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:23,210
The surgery will not help that much.

10
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:27,170
He decides to let the dog go.
